<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0"><b>Securities registered pursuant to Section 12(b) of the Exchange Act:</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&#160;</p>

